---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../../consts';

const pageTitle = `Stage Keys Live - The MainStage for Android | ${SITE_TITLE}`;
const pageDescription = "Stage Keys Live is the live performance audio workstation for Android built with Kotlin and C++ Google Oboe. Play live with SF2 SoundFonts, split & layer zones, ambient worship pads, and USB/Bluetooth MIDI controllers with sub-10ms latency.";
---

<MainLayout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription}>
    <!-- Top Ambient Lights & Glow -->
    <div class="relative pt-10 pb-20">
        <div id="ambient-glow" class="absolute top-[-40px] left-0 right-0 mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl h-[580px] pointer-events-none -z-10 flex items-center justify-center overflow-visible">
            <div class="w-full h-full rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-emerald-500/20 via-cyan-500/25 to-fuchsia-600/20 blur-[130px] transform-gpu"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- HERO SECTION -->
        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 text-center flex flex-col items-center">
            
            <!-- Development Stage Badge (Concentric & Optically Balanced) -->
            <div class="hero-anim flex justify-center w-full mb-7">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-400 text-xs md:text-sm font-semibold backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg shadow-emerald-950/20 ring-1 ring-inset ring-white/5">
                    <span class="relative flex h-2.5 w-2.5">
                        <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75"></span>
                        <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2.5 w-2.5 bg-emerald-400"></span>
                    </span>
                    <span class="tracking-wide uppercase text-[11px] md:text-xs font-bold">Closed Testing Track • Google Play Console</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- App Icon with Specular Layered Glow -->
            <div class="hero-anim flex justify-center w-full mb-6">
                <div class="relative inline-block group">
                    <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-fuchsia-500 via-indigo-500 to-cyan-500 rounded-3xl blur-2xl opacity-45 group-hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity duration-500"></div>
                    <img 
                        src="/images/stagekeyslive-icon.png" 
                        alt="Stage Keys Live Logo" 
                        class="relative w-36 h-36 md:w-48 md:h-48 rounded-3xl shadow-2xl border border-cyan-400/30 object-cover transform transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-105"
                        style="box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2), 0 20px 40px -15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);"
                    />
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Main Title & Tagline -->
            <h1 class="hero-anim text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-4 [text-wrap:balance]">
                STAGE KEYS <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-400 via-teal-300 to-cyan-400">LIVE</span>
            </h1>

            <p class="hero-anim text-lg sm:text-xl md:text-2xl text-slate-200 font-medium max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-4 leading-relaxed [text-wrap:pretty]">
                The <strong class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">MainStage for Android</strong> live keyboardists have been waiting for. No laptop required. Sub-10ms latency.
            </p>

            <p class="hero-anim text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8 leading-relaxed [text-wrap:pretty]">
                Connect your MIDI keyboard via USB or Bluetooth, load high-fidelity <code class="text-xs bg-slate-800/80 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-slate-700 text-cyan-300 font-mono">.sf2</code> SoundFonts, configure visual Split & Layer zones, and trigger continuous <strong class="text-teal-300">Ambient Worship Pads</strong> with seamless crossfade.
            </p>

            <!-- Spec Badges Bar (Concentric, Tabular, Optical) -->
            <div class="hero-anim flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 md:gap-3 max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-10">
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-700/80 text-slate-300 text-xs font-medium backdrop-blur-sm">
                    <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold tabular-nums">&lt; 10ms</span> Latency (Oboe C++)
                </span>
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-700/80 text-slate-300 text-xs font-medium backdrop-blur-sm">
                    <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold tabular-nums">8 Layers</span> Split & Layer
                </span>
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-700/80 text-slate-300 text-xs font-medium backdrop-blur-sm">
                    <span class="text-teal-400 font-bold tabular-nums">12 Keys</span> Ambient Drones
                </span>
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-700/80 text-slate-300 text-xs font-medium backdrop-blur-sm">
                    <span class="text-amber-400 font-bold">MIDI Learn</span> nanoKONTROL
                </span>
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-700/80 text-slate-300 text-xs font-medium backdrop-blur-sm">
                    <span class="text-indigo-400 font-bold">Background</span> Foreground Audio
                </span>
            </div>

            <!-- CTAs with Physical Depress and Specular Insets -->
            <div class="hero-anim flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 mb-16 relative">
                <!-- Beta Tester Jump Button -->
                <a 
                    href="#beta-tester" 
                    class="btn-interact flex items-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 via-teal-400 to-cyan-500 hover:from-emerald-400 hover:to-cyan-400 text-slate-950 font-black text-base shadow-xl shadow-emerald-500/25 border border-emerald-300/40 transform hover:scale-[1.03] active:scale-[0.98] transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer"
                    style="box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4), 0 15px 25px -10px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.5);"
                >
                    <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
                    </svg>
                    <span>Join Closed Beta on Play Store</span>
                </a>

                <!-- Telegram Community Quick Jump -->
                <a 
                    href="https://t.me/StageKeysLiveComunity" 
                    target="_blank" 
                    rel="noopener noreferrer" 
                    class="btn-interact flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-[#0088cc]/20 hover:bg-[#0088cc]/30 border border-[#0088cc]/50 text-[#29b6f6] font-bold text-sm transform hover:scale-[1.03] active:scale-[0.98] transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer shadow-lg shadow-[#0088cc]/20"
                    style="box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);"
                >
                    <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm4.64 6.8c-.15 1.58-.8 5.42-1.13 7.19-.14.75-.42 1-.68 1.03-.58.05-1.02-.38-1.58-.75-.88-.58-1.38-.94-2.23-1.5-.99-.65-.35-1.01.22-1.59.15-.15 2.71-2.48 2.76-2.69a.2.2 0 00-.05-.18c-.06-.05-.14-.03-.21-.02-.09.02-1.49.95-4.22 2.79-.4.27-.76.41-1.08.4-.36-.01-1.04-.2-1.55-.37-.63-.2-1.12-.31-1.08-.66.02-.18.27-.36.74-.55 2.92-1.27 4.86-2.11 5.83-2.51 2.78-1.16 3.35-1.36 3.73-1.36.08 0 .27.02.39.12.1.08.13.19.14.27-.01.06.01.24 0 .38z"/>
                    </svg>
                    <span>Telegram Community</span>
                </a>

                <!-- Like Button with Floating Hearts -->
                <button 
                    id="like-btn" 
                    type="button"
                    class="btn-interact relative group flex items-center gap-3 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 hover:bg-slate-800/90 border border-rose-500/40 text-rose-400 font-bold text-base shadow-xl shadow-rose-950/20 transform hover:scale-[1.03] active:scale-[0.98] transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer overflow-visible"
                    style="box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);"
                >
                    <svg id="like-heart-icon" class="w-6 h-6 transition-transform group-hover:scale-115 text-rose-500 fill-rose-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path d="M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.28 2 8.5 2 5.42 4.42 3 7.5 3c1.74 0 3.41.81 4.5 2.09C13.09 3.81 14.76 3 16.5 3 19.58 3 22 5.42 22 8.5c0 3.78-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.54L12 21.35z"/>
                    </svg>
                    <span>Support Project</span>
                    <span id="like-counter" class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500/20 border border-rose-500/30 text-rose-300 text-sm font-extrabold tabular-nums">...</span>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ========================================== -->
        <!-- INTERACTIVE APP SHOWCASE & REAL SCREENSHOTS -->
        <!-- ========================================== -->
        <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 mt-2 mb-20">
            <div class="text-center mb-8">
                <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-400 font-bold block mb-2">Real Hardware In-App Screenshots</span>
                <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight [text-wrap:balance]">
                    Engineered for the Live Stage
                </h2>
                <p class="text-slate-400 max-w-xl mx-auto mt-3 text-sm md:text-base [text-wrap:pretty]">
                    Explore live captures straight from Stage Keys Live running on Android devices. Click any tab below to inspect each view.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Tab Pills (Concentric & Optical) -->
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-8">
                <button type="button" class="tab-btn active px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs md:text-sm font-bold transition-all cursor-pointer bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/40 shadow-lg shadow-emerald-950/20" data-tab="mixer">
                    🎛️ Live Mixer & Keyboard
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="tab-btn px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs md:text-sm font-bold transition-all cursor-pointer bg-slate-900/60 text-slate-400 hover:text-white border border-slate-800" data-tab="pads">
                    🌊 Ambient Pads (12 Keys)
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="tab-btn px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs md:text-sm font-bold transition-all cursor-pointer bg-slate-900/60 text-slate-400 hover:text-white border border-slate-800" data-tab="splits">
                    🎹 Split & Layer Editor
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="tab-btn px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs md:text-sm font-bold transition-all cursor-pointer bg-slate-900/60 text-slate-400 hover:text-white border border-slate-800" data-tab="midi">
                    🔌 MIDI Learn Mapping
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="tab-btn px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs md:text-sm font-bold transition-all cursor-pointer bg-slate-900/60 text-slate-400 hover:text-white border border-slate-800" data-tab="audio">
                    ⚡ Oboe C++ Engine (&lt;10ms)
                </button>
                <button type="button" class="tab-btn px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs md:text-sm font-bold transition-all cursor-pointer bg-slate-900/60 text-slate-400 hover:text-white border border-slate-800" data-tab="dashboard">
                    📱 Sets & Concerts
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Showcase Card Frame with Concentric Radii and Specular Outline -->
            <div class="relative glass-panel rounded-3xl p-3 md:p-6 border border-white/10 shadow-2xl bg-slate-950/80 overflow-hidden" style="box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1), 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);">
                
                <!-- Screen Content Area -->
                <div class="relative aspect-[24/11] w-full rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 group cursor-pointer image-card" id="showcase-card" data-img="/images/stagekeys/stage-mixer.jpg">
                    <img 
                        id="showcase-img"
                        src="/images/stagekeys/stage-mixer.jpg" 
                        alt="Stage Keys Live Screenshot" 
                        class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.02]"
                    />
                    
                    <!-- Subtle Gradient Scrim at Bottom for Badge Readability -->
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950/80 via-transparent to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>

                    <!-- Overlay Chip Indicating Click to Expand -->
                    <div class="absolute bottom-4 right-4 flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-950/80 border border-slate-700/80 text-slate-300 text-xs font-semibold backdrop-blur-md opacity-90 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">
                        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0zM10 7v3m0 0v3m0-3h3m-3 0H7" />
                        </svg>
                        <span>Click to view full resolution (2400x1080)</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-emerald-500 text-slate-950 text-xs font-black tracking-wider uppercase" id="showcase-badge">
                        Main Concert Mode
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Showcase Dynamic Description Bar -->
                <div class="mt-6 px-3 py-2 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 pt-4" id="showcase-info">
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-1" id="showcase-title">
                            Live Mixer & Touch Keyboard
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm md:text-base max-w-3xl leading-relaxed [text-wrap:pretty]" id="showcase-desc">
                            Complete layer volume control with virtual faders, reactive VU meters per channel, Mute/Solo switches, dedicated Reverb, Chorus and Cutoff knobs, Tap Tempo, live MIDI recorder, and on-screen keyboard with pitch bend and modulation wheel.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 shrink-0" id="showcase-tags">
                        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-300 text-xs font-bold">Virtual Faders</span>
                        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-300 text-xs font-bold">120 BPM • Tap</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>

    <!-- ========================================== -->
    <!-- TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE & STAGE FEATURES    -->
    <!-- ========================================== -->
    <section class="py-16 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="text-center mb-14">
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-400 font-bold block mb-2">High-Performance Engineering</span>
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight [text-wrap:balance]">
                Why It Outperforms Generic Audio Apps
            </h2>
            <p class="text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto mt-3 text-base [text-wrap:pretty]">
                Not another lightweight MIDI player. StageKeysLive is engineered from scratch in native C++ and Kotlin Multiplatform to endure the rigor of stadium worship concerts and sessions.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            
            <!-- Feature 1: Google Oboe C++ Engine -->
            <div class="tech-card glass-panel rounded-3xl p-7 border border-white/10 hover:border-emerald-500/40 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group" style="box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);">
                <div>
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400 mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Google Oboe C++ Engine</h3>
                        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-black bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 tabular-nums">&lt; 10ms</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed [text-wrap:pretty]">
                        Communicates directly with your device's audio chipset via the native AAudio driver in 32-bit floating point at 48kHz, eliminating jitter and providing instantaneous touch response.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400">
                    <span>⚡ Native AAudio Driver</span>
                    <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">xRuns Diagnostics</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Feature 2: FluidSynth SF2 Engine -->
            <div class="tech-card glass-panel rounded-3xl p-7 border border-white/10 hover:border-cyan-500/40 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group" style="box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);">
                <div>
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-400 mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19V6l12-3v13M9 19c0 1.105-1.343 2-3 2s-3-.895-3-2 1.343-2 3-2 3 .895 3 2zm12-3c0 1.105-1.343 2-3 2s-3-.895-3-2 1.343-2 3-2 3 .895 3 2zM9 10l12-3" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">FluidSynth SoundFonts .SF2</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed [text-wrap:pretty]">
                        Load stage-grade acoustic pianos, Rhodes, worship synths, choirs, and strings in .sf2 format. Multi-channel architecture optimized for mobile RAM with integrated Scratch Preview channel.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400">
                    <span>📂 Storage Access (SAF)</span>
                    <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">Scratch Preview OK</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Feature 3: Ambient Worship Pads -->
            <div class="tech-card glass-panel rounded-3xl p-7 border border-white/10 hover:border-teal-500/40 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group" style="box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);">
                <div>
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-teal-500/10 border border-teal-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-teal-400 mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11a7 7 0 01-7 7m0 0a7 7 0 01-7-7m7 7v4m0 0H8m4 0h4m-4-8a3 3 0 100-6 3 3 0 000 6z" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors">Ambient Worship Pads</h3>
                        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-black bg-teal-500/20 text-teal-300">12 Keys</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed [text-wrap:pretty]">
                        Never endure awkward dead air between worship songs again. Trigger continuous atmospheric drone pads (Shimmer, Warm) across all 12 musical keys with seamless crossfade transitions.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400">
                    <span>🌊 Continuous Crossfade</span>
                    <span class="text-teal-400 font-bold">Zero Dead Silence</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Feature 4: Seamless Spillover -->
            <div class="tech-card glass-panel rounded-3xl p-7 border border-white/10 hover:border-purple-500/40 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group" style="box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);">
                <div>
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-400 mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 5a1 1 0 011-1h14a1 1 0 011 1v2a1 1 0 01-1 1H5a1 1 0 01-1-1V5zM4 13a1 1 0 011-1h6a1 1 0 011 1v6a1 1 0 01-1 1H5a1 1 0 01-1-1v-6zM16 13a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v6a1 1 0 01-1 1h-2a1 1 0 01-1-1v-6z" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-purple-400 transition-colors">Seamless Spillover</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed [text-wrap:pretty]">
                        When switching patches mid-song, notes held by the sustain pedal and lingering reverb tails are never abruptly cut off. Shadow audio channels managed by Kotlin coroutines keep the music flowing.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400">
                    <span>🎹 Shadow Channels</span>
                    <span class="text-purple-400 font-bold">Natural Decay</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Feature 5: MIDI Learn & nanoKONTROL -->
            <div class="tech-card glass-panel rounded-3xl p-7 border border-white/10 hover:border-amber-500/40 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between group" style="box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);">
                <div>
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400 mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6V4m0 2a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m-6 8a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4m6 6v10m6-2a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors">MIDI Learn & nanoKONTROL</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed [text-wrap:pretty]">
                        Connect Korg nanoKONTROL2, Arturia, Novation, or any controller via USB OTG or Bluetooth MIDI. Map volume faders, effect knobs, and mute switches instantly with one physical touch.
